{"2212910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Expeditions: Samurai", "steam_appid": 2212910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/0ebdfa0ef79e4ae40c1f27bfd3034028.avif?t=1786110990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras_big/0ebdfa0ef79e4ae40c1f27bfd3034028.webp?t=1786110990 width=1560 height=231 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/d60dd2f7a206d12c18eb7f44e3d7d43c.poster.avif?t=1786110990\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/d60dd2f7a206d12c18eb7f44e3d7d43c.webm?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/d60dd2f7a206d12c18eb7f44e3d7d43c.mp4?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Expeditions: Samurai is an expansive roleplaying game set in our world during <strong>real historical events</strong>, with an intricate, branching story and a <strong>vibrant cast of characters</strong>. At every turn, you will be faced with life-or-death choices that will challenge your resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the character you want to be and choose your own path through history. Even the smallest of your decisions can have <strong>far-reaching consequences</strong> for yourself, your crew, and - in many cases - the people of Japan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/1f55f14b8fd1c7056b6cba6bc9a5a369.avif?t=1786110990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras_big/1f55f14b8fd1c7056b6cba6bc9a5a369.webp?t=1786110990 width=1560 height=231 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/bffdfa371dbebb5c755db9c233f4fb89.poster.avif?t=1786110990\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/bffdfa371dbebb5c755db9c233f4fb89.webm?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/bffdfa371dbebb5c755db9c233f4fb89.mp4?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the year 1600</strong>, the navigator William Adams arrived in Japan. He would soon become the first European granted the title of &quot;Samurai&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Expeditions: Samurai, William Adams never leaves England; <strong><i>you</i></strong> will beat Adams to the punch and sail to Japan aboard <strong>the Dutch frigate De Albatros</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive in Japan as the newly elected leader of a motley crew of privateers and are quickly swept up in an ongoing <strong>civil war</strong> that is nearing its climax. Navigate the politics, intrigue, and <strong>drama of feudal Japan</strong> as you and your crew catch the attention of powerful warlords whose struggle will determine the future of the nation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/f7ad9938a7de49a110386cb2e579c72d.avif?t=1786110990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras_big/f7ad9938a7de49a110386cb2e579c72d.webp?t=1786110990 width=1560 height=231 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/9dab84877b188a63a406048d8ca2a3fc.poster.avif?t=1786110990\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/9dab84877b188a63a406048d8ca2a3fc.webm?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/9dab84877b188a63a406048d8ca2a3fc.mp4?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crewmate has their own story to uncover - if you manage to <strong>earn their trust</strong>. Build your relationship with each companion into a meaningful friendship, a lifelong rivalry, or possibly even <strong>a new love</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/d91f94bb193c4f23365e2a33029b6db9.avif?t=1786110990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras_big/d91f94bb193c4f23365e2a33029b6db9.webp?t=1786110990 width=1560 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/8d0459f2302fd53c38d4964e5bc5503e.poster.avif?t=1786110990\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/8d0459f2302fd53c38d4964e5bc5503e.webm?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/8d0459f2302fd53c38d4964e5bc5503e.mp4?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outnumbered but never outgunned, engage your enemies on your own terms in a <strong>fast and freeing turn-based combat</strong> system where movement, attacks, and interruptions can all play out simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>stealth and clever gadgets</strong> to toy with your opponents. Split up your team to position them in real-time and set up devastating ambushes. Utilize a vast array of weapons and abilities to maintain the upper hand - from mainstays of the pirate arsenal to iconic Japanese weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your own items</strong> and experiment with different loadouts to survive deadly and diverse enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/0622c9bbba4c52dcefab0a043d3fb243.avif?t=1786110990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras_big/0622c9bbba4c52dcefab0a043d3fb243.webp?t=1786110990 width=1560 height=231 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/2d9a449d915a50634ab4160c723c25ea.poster.avif?t=1786110990\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/2d9a449d915a50634ab4160c723c25ea.webm?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/2d9a449d915a50634ab4160c723c25ea.mp4?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the first time ever in an Expeditions game, experience the tense combat and deeply branching narrative of Expeditions: Samurai in <strong>drop-in/drop-out co-op</strong>. Play in single-player as your own Captain Flynn, or invite your friend and play as a pair of twins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In co-op, talking to characters at the same time lets you wrestle for control of important decisions or compete for a companion's affections. <strong>Coordinate sneak attacks or clever combat maneuvers</strong>; throw a distracting firecracker at just the right time to let your partner sneak past a sentry, or execute a flawlessly timed <strong>double stealth takedown</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/0ebdfa0ef79e4ae40c1f27bfd3034028.avif?t=1786110990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras_big/0ebdfa0ef79e4ae40c1f27bfd3034028.webp?t=1786110990 width=1560 height=231 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/d60dd2f7a206d12c18eb7f44e3d7d43c.poster.avif?t=1786110990\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/d60dd2f7a206d12c18eb7f44e3d7d43c.webm?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/d60dd2f7a206d12c18eb7f44e3d7d43c.mp4?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Expeditions: Samurai is an expansive roleplaying game set in our world during <strong>real historical events</strong>, with an intricate, branching story and a <strong>vibrant cast of characters</strong>. At every turn, you will be faced with life-or-death choices that will challenge your resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the character you want to be and choose your own path through history. Even th