nation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/f7ad9938a7de49a110386cb2e579c72d.avif?t=1786110990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras_big/f7ad9938a7de49a110386cb2e579c72d.webp?t=1786110990 width=1560 height=231 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/9dab84877b188a63a406048d8ca2a3fc.poster.avif?t=1786110990\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/9dab84877b188a63a406048d8ca2a3fc.webm?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/9dab84877b188a63a406048d8ca2a3fc.mp4?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crewmate has their own story to uncover - if you manage to <strong>earn their trust</strong>. Build your relationship with each companion into a meaningful friendship, a lifelong rivalry, or possibly even <strong>a new love</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/d91f94bb193c4f23365e2a33029b6db9.avif?t=1786110990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras_big/d91f94bb193c4f23365e2a33029b6db9.webp?t=1786110990 width=1560 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/8d0459f2302fd53c38d4964e5bc5503e.poster.avif?t=1786110990\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/8d0459f2302fd53c38d4964e5bc5503e.webm?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/8d0459f2302fd53c38d4964e5bc5503e.mp4?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outnumbered but never outgunned, engage your enemies on your own terms in a <strong>fast and freeing turn-based combat</strong> system where movement, attacks, and interruptions can all play out simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>stealth and clever gadgets</strong> to toy with your opponents. Split up your team to position them in real-time and set up devastating ambushes. Utilize a vast array of weapons and abilities to maintain the upper hand - from mainstays of the pirate arsenal to iconic Japanese weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your own items</strong> and experiment with different loadouts to survive deadly and diverse enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/0622c9bbba4c52dcefab0a043d3fb243.avif?t=1786110990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras_big/0622c9bbba4c52dcefab0a043d3fb243.webp?t=1786110990 width=1560 height=231 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/2d9a449d915a50634ab4160c723c25ea.poster.avif?t=1786110990\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/2d9a449d915a50634ab4160c723c25ea.webm?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/extras/2d9a449d915a50634ab4160c723c25ea.mp4?t=1786110990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the first time ever in an Expeditions game, experience the tense combat and deeply branching narrative of Expeditions: Samurai in <strong>drop-in/drop-out co-op</strong>. Play in single-player as your own Captain Flynn, or invite your friend and play as a pair of twins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In co-op, talking to characters at the same time lets you wrestle for control of important decisions or compete for a companion's affections. <strong>Coordinate sneak attacks or clever combat maneuvers</strong>; throw a distracting firecracker at just the right time to let your partner sneak past a sentry, or execute a flawlessly timed <strong>double stealth takedown</strong>.</p>", "short_description": "The sun rises on another civil war, as you land in Japan aboard a battered Dutch ship. Thrust into command of its motley crew, you must navigate the politics of Sengoku-era Japan using stealth, diplomacy, or violence in this party-based RPG where every choice matters.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/29cb808b9180f69adf09cf86fe5ffd25b74e04b6/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1786110990", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/a1ae8e871a34a157e2cf47571a0407a61f010623/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1786110990", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212910/a1ae8e871a34a157e2cf47571a0407a61f010623/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1786110990", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br><